WEBVTT

00:00.843 --> 00:02.343
[Alt+Shift+C opens the table of contents, with focus on the current section]

00:03.104 --> 00:04.604
[Tab to the next section]

00:04.791 --> 00:06.291
[Alt+Shift+V goes to Show levels]

00:06.773 --> 00:08.273
[Up arrow chooses 3 levels]

00:08.460 --> 00:09.960
[Up arrow again chooses 2]

00:10.855 --> 00:12.355
[Down arrow, twice, goes back to all levels]

00:12.547 --> 00:14.047
[Shift+Tab goes to Find a section]

00:14.095 --> 00:15.595
[types “Russia”, which narrows the sections]

00:17.262 --> 00:18.762
[Enter opens the first match, “3.9 Valentin Haüy in Russia”]
